{"id": "DfcHi0Yywkm", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Diwali kyun manayi jaati hai? Yeh sawaal khud Kartikeya ne Bhagwan Shiv se poocha tha 🪔\n\nPaanch din, har din ki apni baat: Yamraj ka diya, bhor ka tel snan, har jagah jalte diye, pitron ka shraddh, Maa Lakshmi ko jagana, aur woh paase ka khel jismein Maa Parvati jeeti thi.\n\nDiwali ke agle din ki ek galti poora saal bigaad sakti hai. Woh kya hai, Part 2 mein.\n\nSource: Padma Purana, Uttara Khand\n\n#diwali #diwali2026 #mahadev #lordshiva #sanatandharma", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1794052609, "like_count": 6881, "comment_count": 25, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1145978987928040a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 56.002, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPcXJNYAP_9atQxASjd6u14plGQpTxeAitzRtyxMBoqdHe8-TeMMuFxCxWFa4_ohZbPO-f_7lpREa9k5XW1wbmMkdzqKJgxw0bCE1o.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adoxr7rJv7uZG9nW5k-5dUG1NHZ_GAG5LtkdIuEcaPHGyc30rOPgOQx1XC9Yir-mp_gyjtTd4hFL7bW5eO6Dnzv5&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=nswwqV8_mqMQ7kNvwFJh-He&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=qaYJU9QE-2m-VRGYsqn1IA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRXYgnivzltOdzzwi3lVg00SxI1SRoyVReVdMgNwgLXnw&oe=6AF458B7", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 56.002, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1145978987